3.104.953The Examiner has not explained how the misting system of Humberstone would be incorporated into the Yamashita while at the same time maintaining the effectiveness of the medicine supply and medicine collection subsystems of Yamashita. Indeed, such a configuration does not even seem possible. That is, how would the medicine be delivered? Through the mesh? And how would it be collected? None of these issues are addressed in the Office Action.
